### 1) Outbox ile sipariş oluştur
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "C-55120",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "P-100", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 1499.90 },
    { "productId": "P-200", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 899.00 }
  ]
}

### 2) Outbox + commit öncesi hata -> sipariş ve outbox birlikte rollback
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders?simulateFailure=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "C-55121", "items": [ { "productId": "P-100", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 1499.90 } ] }

### 3) NAIVE (dual write) + hata -> hayalet event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/naive?failAfterPublish=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "C-66666", "items": [ { "productId": "P-300", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 449.50 } ] }

### Siparişler
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders

### Outbox kayıtları
GET http://localhost:8080/api/outbox

### Outbox metrikleri (bekleyen, başarısız, en eski bekleyenin yaşı)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/outbox/stats

### Fatura servisi: faturalar ve inbox
GET http://localhost:8080/api/invoices

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inbox

### --- Demo anahtarları ---
POST http://localhost:8080/api/demo/relay/pause

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/demo/relay/resume

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/demo/broker/down

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/demo/broker/up

### Relay, bir sonraki gönderimden sonra processed_at yazmadan çöksün (duplicate senaryosu)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/demo/relay/crash-next

### Actuator metriği
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/metrics/outbox.pending.count
